    "profile": {
      "text": "",
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "Mlp92T0k3DUvKn89WuQiF",
          "text": "<p style=\"text-align:justify\">A Frontend Developer with <strong>4+</strong> years of experience, dedicated to creating user-friendly web solutions and continuous learning. <strong>Proactively</strong> communicates, remains curious, and willingly takes on tasks beyond the <strong>usual scope</strong>. Thrives on solving complex UI challenges with creative thinking and a performance-first approach. Careful about optimizing load times, and automating<strong> SEO</strong> processes to ensure <strong>ongoing website effectiveness</strong>. Quick to master new dashboards and <strong>CRMs</strong>, driving team efficiency and consistently delivering high-impact project outcomes.</p>",
          "isHidden": true,
          "createdAt": "2025-08-21T16:59:31.321Z",
          "updatedAt": "2025-08-21T16:59:31.321Z",
          "isNewEntry": false,
          "updated_at": "2024-10-14T11:53:51.005Z",
          "showPlaceholder": false
        },
        {
          "id": "cA5Z1vdlYRWdP3S4hYCDm",
          "text": "<p>Experienced Frontend Developer with a proven track record of delivering high-performance, <strong>SEO</strong>-optimized websites. Skilled in <strong>Vue, Nuxt, Javascript, Typescript, HTML, and CSS/Sass</strong>. Proven ability to collaborate effectively in cross-functional teams and meet tight deadlines. Demonstrated expertise in transforming complex requirements into intuitive and user-friendly interfaces.</p>",
          "isHidden": true,
          "created_at": "2024-09-12T21:11:09.922Z",
          "isNewEntry": false,
          "updated_at": "2024-09-12T21:11:09.922Z",
          "showPlaceholder": false
        },
        {
          "id": "71fb6209-c750-4e06-912e-81a71c389667",
          "text": "<p>A Data & Content Quality Specialist with expertise in <strong>AI output evaluation, data annotation, QA, and linguistic review</strong>. Proven ability to assess <strong>Persian/English</strong> content for accuracy, cultural relevance, and safety compliance. Adept at handling large datasets under structured guidelines to enhance AI model performance.</p>",
          "isHidden": true,
          "createdAt": "2025-08-21T16:58:50.835Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-05-15T07:16:41.435Z",
          "showPlaceholder": false
        },
        {
          "id": "2ff58239-775f-4833-b31a-8c207f35e7dc",
          "text": "<p>Frontend Engineer with 4+ years delivering scalable, accessible web applications using React, Vue.js, and Nuxt. Skilled in the Composition API, modular component architecture, semantic HTML, modern CSS, and RESTful API integration, consistently achieving 95%+ Lighthouse performance scores. Experienced in security, unit, and end‑to‑end testing workflows and maintaining CI/CD pipelines. Collaborative in cross‑functional Agile teams, partnering with design, product, and backend engineering to build high‑quality user interfaces at scale.</p>",
          "isHidden": false,
          "createdAt": "2026-05-15T07:16:26.703Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-05-16T07:22:57.797Z",
          "showPlaceholder": false
        }
      ],
